  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">South Africa - Newton International Fellowship</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Grants to support international researchers to spend two years in some of the UK&#x2019;s best universities.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The primary aims of the Newton International Fellowship programme are to:
&#x2022; Support the development of a well-trained research community by supporting reserachers at an early stage of their career by providing an opportunity to work at a UK research institution for
two years.
&#x2022; Establish links between researchers in partner countries and the UK to contribute to developing research and innovation capacity</narrative>
  </description>
